# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository. Without this, Windows
# checkouts rewrite committed LF files as CRLF and every `git status` reports
# them modified -- four JSON files showed 51-line diffs in a 52-line file,
# which is pure noise and obscures real changes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touched
*.pdb binary
*.png binary
*.pickle binary
*.dcd binary
*.a3m binary
